  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "At crescent lake in Northern Plains, Yan tribe Gu Masters jointly activate this Gu while facing Fang Yuan’s wolf group. Green threads ride the wind as it surrounds everyone. Assaults from the pack and wild Gu on wolf kings vanish into that formless wind without leaving a lasting mark. The barrier is like a tortoise shell that firmly protects everyone inside it, and Yan tribe is famous for defensive skill in northern plains.",
